<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Compyvila — Media Kit</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f8f7f2;color:#20231f;font:15px/1.7 Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:850px;margin:50px auto;padding:40px 55px;border-top:5px solid #f15a24}h1{font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 18px}h2{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px;border-top:1px solid #d9ddd1;padding-top:24px;margin-top:35px}h3{font-size:18px;margin:23px 0 7px}p{color:#646b5b;margin:9px 0}h1+p{font-family:monospace;color:#f15a24;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:12px}@media print{body{background:white}main{margin:0;padding:25px}h2,h3{break-after:avoid}p{break-inside:avoid}}@media(max-width:600px){main{margin:20px;padding:25px 5px}h1{font-size:35px}}</style></head><body><main><h1>Compyvila. Media Kit</h1><p>Independent thinking. A clearer view of crypto.</p><h2>Our audience</h2><p>{{ setting('media_audience') }}</p><h2>Partnership opportunities</h2><h3>Display placement</h3><p>Homepage and section placements. Desktop creative: 970 × 250 px. Mobile creative: 320 × 100 px.</p><h3>Briefing sponsorship</h3><p>Clearly labelled sponsor message with logo, headline, and destination link. Schedule and copy agreed before launch.</p><h3>Sponsored feature</h3><p>Dedicated commercial story with explicit disclosure and editorial review. Sponsorship does not guarantee independent editorial coverage.</p><h2>Audience and rates</h2><p>Verified reach, subscriber counts, campaign availability, and rates are shared on request when available. No audience figures are claimed in this kit.</p><h2>Brand guidelines</h2><p>Orange #F15A24 · Charcoal #20231F · Ivory #F8F7F2. Keep logos in proportion and leave clear space around the wordmark.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>{{ setting('media_email') ?: 'Use the media enquiry form on the Compyvila website.' }}</p><p>Prepared {{ date('d M Y') }}. Save this document or print it to PDF from your browser.</p></main></body></html>
